<div class="stonetop-playbook-picker-body">
	<div class="stonetop-playbook-picker-intro">
		<p>Your <strong>playbook</strong> is who your hero is in Stonetop&mdash;their role in the village, their strengths, and the special moves they bring to the table. There's no wrong pick, so choose whatever sparks your imagination.</p>
		<p>Hover over any card for a short description and a sense of how complex it is to play. New to the village? The <strong>Setting Overview</strong> button sketches Stonetop and the world around it.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="stonetop-playbook-picker-topbar">
		<button type="button" class="stonetop-playbook-picker-setting-overview">Setting Overview</button>
	</div>
	<div class="stonetop-playbook-picker-grid">
		{{#each playbooks}}
		<button type="button"
			class="stonetop-playbook-picker-card stonetop-playbook-picker-card--{{slug}}"
			data-uuid="{{uuid}}"
			data-complexity="{{complexity}}"
			data-description="{{description}}"
		>
			{{#if img}}
			<img class="stonetop-playbook-picker-card-icon" src="{{img}}" alt="">
			{{/if}}
			<span class="stonetop-playbook-picker-card-name">{{name}}</span>
		</button>
		{{/each}}
	</div>
</div>
